        "native_id": 11509,
        "number_of_reviews": 1,
        "owner_reply": "Hello,\nThank you for taking the time to share such detailed feedback. We're sorry to hear the packaging did not meet your expectations upon arrival. Your comments regarding the clasp and the need for additional cushioning to better protect the pearls during transit will be shared with our team. We're glad the rest of your purchase experience was a positive one.\n\nBest regards,\nThe Pearl Source",
        "owner_reply_date": "2026-06-06T21:48:31Z",
        "owner_reply_updated_date": null,
        "page_number": 10,
        "rating_value": 4,
        "report": null,
        "review_body": "I deducted one start because of the way the pearls were found upon arrival. I am very fussy about pearls and did not appreciate the right top clip being open so the entire trip my pearls were rubbing against each other. There needed to be a cushion layer above the pearls to hold them firmly in place to prevent rubbing against the box and each other. Otherwise, the purchase was fine.",
