        "native_id": 11510,
        "number_of_reviews": 1,
        "owner_reply": "We are truly sorry to hear about the repeated issues with your pearl ring and the frustration this has caused, especially losing the pearl. We understand how disappointing this experience has been. We are committed to improving our product quality and repair processes. We appreciate you bringing this to our attention.",
        "owner_reply_date": "2026-06-25T19:14:51Z",
        "owner_reply_updated_date": null,
        "page_number": 10,
        "rating_value": 1,
        "report": null,
        "review_body": "This company does not stand by their product. My fiance bought me a very expensive pearl ring and one year later the pearl fell off of the post. I sent it back and  they said that it was fixed and a couple months later it fell off for a second time. I pleaded for them to just replace the ring at this point; but they didn’t.   They guaranteed me for the SECOND time that it wouldn’t happen another time.  I was incredibly lucky that it fell off in front of me both times.  Well, a month ago, it happened again in the middle of a grassy field! This time the pearl was not to be found! They said they would repair  it for $278. Unfortunately, I no longer have the pearl anymore!!!! Not good enough for the third time! Extremely disappointing! I would NEVER recommend this company!!",
